ate":{"kind":"literal","value":true},"position":"objective","objective_title_i18n":{"cn":"击败成为恶魔傀儡的大公","en":"Corrupted Archduke","jp":"傀儡になった大公を倒す","kr":"악마의 꼭두각시가 된 대공 처치하기"},"objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"谒见大厅内，亚莲娜公主握住大公的手，祝福大公得到“解脱”，而宫廷魔法师迪尔格雷解除了控制大公的魔法，使大公彻底沦为恶魔的傀儡。无奈之下，你们必须先击败变为恶魔傀儡的大公！","en":"In the great hall, Princess Yolena is standing next to the Archduke. Cyran removes the magic that controls the Archduke and turns him into a Hypogean puppet. You just defeated the corrupted Archduke.","jp":"謁見の間では、エレナが大公の手を握り、彼は「解放」されたと伝えた。そして宮廷魔術師のディアグレスが大公を操っていた魔法を解くと、大公は完全にカタストロフの傀儡と化した。やむを得ないが、まずは大公を倒すしかないようだ……！","kr":"알현실 안에서 알레나 공주는 대공의 손을 잡고 그가 “해방”될 수 있도록 축복하고 있었다. 궁정 마법사 딜그레이는 대공을 제어하는 마법을 풀고 그를 악마의 꼭두각시로 전락시켰다. 어쩔 수 없이 대공을 처치해야 한다!"},"assembly_key":"season_3/season_3/main_story/13010112"}},"timeline/timeline_story_13110910":{"before:13010112:5:9":{"step":"13010112:5:9","rules":[{"kind":"scripted_encounter_finished","state":"DramaMonster_Finished","object_ids":["507800066"],"operator":">=","count":1}],"objects":[{"id":"507800066","type":"58","client_type":"UnbeatableMonster","battle_group_id":"110942","flow_canvas":"","auto_interact":"false","interaction_candidates":[{"state":"1","condition":"ed.ConditionX.CanBeOverwhelmedInRetro()","options":[{"id":"32","type":"Overwhelm","active_interact":"false"}]},{"state":"2","condition":"ed.ConditionX.CanBeOverwhelmed()","options":[{"id":"32","type":"Overwhelm","active_interact":"false"},{"id":"2","type":"Battle","active_interact":"true"},{"id":"1","type":"Info","active_interact":"false"}]},{"state":"3","condition":"ed.ConditionX.HasState(\"CMark_1\")","options":[{"id":"2","type":"Battle","active_interact":"true"},{"id":"1","type":"Info","active_interact":"false"}]},{"state":"4","condition":"true","options":[{"id":"2","type":"Battle","active_interact":"true"},{"id":"1","type":"Info","active_interact":"false"}]}],"note":"conditional options; no state selection or automatic/manual exclusivity inferred"}],"context_guards":[],